{"id":"00066","root":"uni00066_1","name":{"ja":"秋山　凜子","en":"Akiyama Rinko"},"title":{"ja":"【斬鬼の対魔忍】","en":"【Slasher Taimanin】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【斬鬼の対魔忍】 秋山　凜子","en":"【Slasher Taimanin】 Akiyama Rinko"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-11-02","limited":false,"characterId":1,"profile":{"ja":"ゆきかぜの幼馴染で姉のような存在。太刀の使い手。忍の里に代々伝わる剣術『逸刀流』の皆伝。“斬鬼の対魔忍”と恐れられる手練の美しき剣客。学園の評判では強く美しく厳しい先輩として見られている。恋愛より妹弟を愛でるのが楽しいためか、数多の男子の求愛にまったく興味を示さない。女子生徒の中でも絶大な人気があり、秘かに凜子様ファンクラブなるものが存在し強い広がりを見せている。小太郎に対しては、ゆきかぜの同級生かつ自身の後輩として接している。","en":"Akiyama Rinko is Mizuki Yukikaze's childhood friend and a sister-like presence to her. She is a master of the tachi and a full-transmission holder of the hereditary sword style \"Itsutō-ryū\" passed down through the Ninja Village. Feared as the \"Demon-slaying Taimanin,\" she is a skilled and beautiful swordswoman. Within the academy she is regarded as a strong, beautiful, and strict senior. She shows no interest in the countless suitors courting her, perhaps because she finds more joy in caring for younger siblings. Among the female students she enjoys immense popularity, and a secret \"Lady Rinko fan club\" has quietly flourished. Regarding Fuuma Kotaro, she treats him as both a classmate of Mizuki Yukikaze and her own junior."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00066_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1122,2244],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[166,332],"def":[145,290],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","40005"]},{"id":"uni00066_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1644,3288],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[257,514],"def":[215,430],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","40005","40006"]},{"id":"uni00066_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2166,4331],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[348,694],"def":[285,569],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","40005","40